# CROSS-REF AUDIT — Internal links across boards, guide, and SHIPPED

File: openOODA/audit/cross_ref_audit.oot
Date: 2026-08-19. Method: Grep every backtick-quoted `.oo` and `.oot` reference in the 9 boards + the guide + SHIPPED. Resolve each against the file tree. Mark status. Did not crawl external URLs (https://openooda.org, https://github.com/openOODA, https://registry.openooda.org) since those are server-rendered.

## 0. Update 2026-08-19 (post-SHIPPED split)

- SHIPPED.oot was split from 533 lines to 97 lines (see `audit/shipped_size_audit.oot` — split has been performed).
- 158 unique .oo refs (old count) is now 135 unique .oo refs in the post-split SHIPPED.oot.
- library_status split: 19 siblings (old claim) is now 22 siblings (1 door + support_1..3, trunk_1..2, tail_1..17 = 22). All under 256 lines. Sum of rows = 4476. Status split (GREEN 2789 / BLOCKED 1627 / RESIDUAL 60 / UNCHECKED 0) consistent across all siblings.
- Cross-ref counts below updated to match the current tree.

## 1. Top-line

- 135 unique `.oo` files referenced in SHIPPED.oot alone (post-split count).
- 0 dead `.oo` references: every named lock file exists in `ooda/`.
- 0 dead guide page references: every `/guide/#X.oot` resolves to a real `guide/X.oot`.
- 1 stale `og:url` on the registry 404 (unfixed).
- 0 stale board refs: `audit/roadmap_ns_rollup.oot` self-acknowledges being a 2026-08-16 historical synthesis on its line 4 ("Historical: 2026-08-16 phalanx synthesis. Repinned to current release for honesty; production-gap rows were folded into ROADMAP.oot §5 Open at the time. Not a live doc."). The v0.200.0-beta pin on line 5 is labeled "Pin (at time of writing)" with "Current pin: v0.205.0-beta" right next to it. No fix needed — the file is honest about being historical.

